DIRECT p0 SINGLE-FAR KERNEL
  D(t)=1[t=0].  With one inserted far color, only t=1 can change p0.
  t=0: P1=1 coeffs_h=['0'] silent
  t=1: P1=1/7 coeffs_h=['-1/7', '6/7'] LIVE
  t=2: P1=0 coeffs_h=['0', '0'] silent
